  "authors": [],
  "body": {
    "comment": "I vote ABSTAIN on \"State of the Cardano Developer Ecosystem - 2026 Survey\" (706449f5192f3951a3c3cb1485215c7c02c951114e75f00147d6e2dfd16d657d#0).\n\nThis Info Action functions as a call to action for the 2026 \"[State of the Cardano Developer Ecosystem](https://devsurvey.cardano.org/?lang=en)\" survey. There is no on-chain voting action required here, although the [proposal metadata](https://bafybeigu7w3nb5xtjwagapv7t74djj4ojgnopiwyidps36vvuqjsfue3we.ipfs.inbrowser.link) itself states: \"You don't need to vote. This action doesn't change anything or ask for a decision. If you'd still like to record a vote, Abstain is the way to go.\" Therefore, this Abstain vote is submitted as both [SPO](https://cardanoscan.io/pool/pool17n47upcpnzsdks0yd409nf79sg6hqy73twg87eddwh24uj745rt) and [DRep](https://cardanoscan.io/drep/drep1y2zu74gt8sxtrxcngqsmrnupkzrtmlqshmvmm5qtuhxx6xqt7yhaw) simply to maintain an on-chain voting record."
  },
  "hashAlgorithm": "blake2b-256"
}
